        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Baalaadae ya/abuuse a ya/aáw ar múk Kushi gu naxwtá aw, kudá' ti xuá' iwa baraá wayda. Inooín gurhaamír ur giri eér bál Misri bara hhaamiís. Ar ló' deelo ni hi'ít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slahhángw geera bál tawa faanqw, kurkú mibaá nee wák, iimír atén tiwa loohatís, axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, aníng dákw waawutmo Farao oo Misri ugwa geeqáw, inós kwaa tseegiiká as kuwa hungu/uusi, nee paánga ooharo ngiwa aleeslay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, Aníng nee Farao ti araán, waawutmoó yaamaá Misri. Dabaawós tsaraawo in giqáw, kudá' hhoó' nee kudá' taa geeqayi. Nee aníng paángadá' gawaá dakós i dirii' an yaamií kwaáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Misri u diyaá/ baraá xoordu sleémeero, nee ngiri tsiyayaáx baraá hhapeemaá hatlá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng dabaá waawutmoó Babuloni in /uurií qaás, nee paángar'eé' ngiri qaás gawaá dakós. Ala dabaá waawutmo Farao in giqáw, nee inós iri /iif geeraá waawutmoó Babulonír wa alé, adór heé taa ló'wa tlaaqán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabaá waawutmoó Babuloni in /uurií qaás, ala dabaá waawutmo Farao nin huuiyá'. Daqaní kuungá' a tsahhá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, qoomár án paángar'eé' bar aga qaás gawaá dabaá waawutmoó Babuloni, dakós guri tlees gawaá yaamaá Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng múk Misri un diyaá/ baraá tla/ángw xoordaá hatlá' nee ngiri tsiyayaáx baraá ayeemaá hatlá'. Daqaní ngi tsaahhiyá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
